;font-size:9px&#x27;&gt;&lt;div style=&#x27;color:#55626C;font-family:sans-serif&#x27;&gt;피드백·결과를 받는 쪽&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&#x27;font-family:monospace&#x27;&gt;do_adjust() · inspect() 반환&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E2EBF2;strokeColor=#2F5D7C;strokeWidth=1.4;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;overflow=fill;" vertex="1" parent="p3-1"><mxGeometry x="779.5" y="1514.8" width="165.0" height="57.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p3-n16" value="&lt;div style=&#x27;font-size:8px;color:#5B4BA6&#x27;&gt;제공 노드 · 흐름 생략&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&#x27;font-family:monospace;font-weight:bold;font-size:11px&#x27;&gt;oakd (depthai-ros)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&#x27;font-size:9px&#x27;&gt;&lt;div style=&#x27;font-family:monospace&#x27;&gt;{ns}/oakd/rgb/image_raw/compressed&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&#x27;font-family:monospace&#x27;&gt;{ns}/oakd/stereo/image_raw (depth)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ECEAF3;strokeColor=#5B4BA6;strokeWidth=2.2;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;overflow=fill;" vertex="1" parent="p3-1"><mxGeometry x="1023.5" y="143.8" width="199.0" height="57.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p3-n17" value="&lt;div style=&#x27;font-family:monospace;font-weight:bold;font-size:11px&#x27;&gt;facilities.yaml&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&#x27;font-size:9px&#x27;&gt;&lt;div style=&#x27;font-family:monospace&#x27;&gt;id · kind · expected{x,y} · view{x,y,yaw} · band&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=cylinder3;boundedLbl=1;size=8;rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF6DC;strokeColor=#8A6D1F;strokeWidth=1.4;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;overflow=fill;" vertex="1" parent="p3-1"><mxGeometry x="880.5" y="0.0" width="273.0" height="46.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p3-n18" value="&lt;div style=&#x27;font-family:monospace;font-weight:bold;font-size:11px&#x27;&gt;best.pt (YOLOv8)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&#x27;font-size:9px&#x