gn)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&#x27;font-size:9px&#x27;&gt;&lt;div style=&#x27;font-family:monospace&#x27;&gt;PENDING 이고 preferred == from 이며&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&#x27;font-family:monospace&#x27;&gt;to ∈ allowed_robot_ids 인 작업만 옮김 → moved_tasks&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#DFEEE7;strokeColor=#2B6A55;strokeWidth=1.4;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;overflow=fill;" vertex="1" parent="p4-1"><mxGeometry x="1376.3" y="240.0" width="278.0" height="46.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p4-n32" value="&lt;div style=&#x27;font-size:8px;color:#2B6A55&#x27;&gt;다른 노드 (5·6번 시트)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&#x27;font-family:monospace;font-weight:bold;font-size:11px&#x27;&gt;관제 웹 → ros_bridge&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&#x27;font-size:9px&#x27;&gt;&lt;div style=&#x27;color:#55626C;font-family:sans-serif&#x27;&gt;버튼: 순찰 시작 · 비상정지 · 재개 · 재배정&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;dashed=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#DFEEE7;strokeColor=#2B6A55;strokeWidth=1.4;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;overflow=fill;" vertex="1" parent="p4-1"><mxGeometry x="73.3" y="94.5" width="180.0" height="45.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p4-n33" value="&lt;div style=&#x27;font-family:monospace;font-weight:bold;font-size:11px&#x27;&gt;zones.yaml&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&#x27;font-size:9px&#x27;&gt;&lt;div style=&#x27;font-family:monospace&#x27;&gt;zones[]: id · robot · dock · polygon · spacing 0.5&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=cylinder3;boundedLbl=1;size=8;rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF6DC;strokeColor=#8A6D1F;strokeWidth=1.4;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;overflow=fill;" vertex="1" parent="p4-1"><mxGeometry x="3593.8" y="239.6" width="283.0" height="46.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p4-n34" value="&lt;div style=&#x27;font-family:monospace;font-weight:bold;font-size:11px&#x27;&gt;facilities.yaml&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&#x27;font-size:9px&#x27;&gt;&lt;div style=&#x27